    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d51">

                <pb facs="0169" n="65" xml:id="pg65"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/1999: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Commission of Neutrals to
                        the Paraguayan Minister for Foreign Affairs (Arbo)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-08-10">August 10,
                        1932</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>With reference our cable 8th instant Bolivia informs us that “we suspended
                    hostilities several days ago” and that “hostilities suspended temporarily.”</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry L. Stimson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State of the United States</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fabio Lozano T.</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister of Colombia</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">José Richling</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires of Uruguay</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">José T. Barón</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires of Cuba</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">P. Herrera de Huerta</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires of Mexico</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
